menu "PlantHub Integrations"

config PLANTHUB_INFLUX_TLS
    bool "Enable HTTPS for the InfluxDB client"
    default n
    help
        Compiles TLS support into the Influx HTTP client and allows
        https:// URLs in the Influx config. Off by default to save
        flash (PlanV1 3.7); the v1 trust model is a trusted LAN over
        plain http. The MQTT client is unaffected (always plain
        mqtt:// in v1).

endmenu
